     2024   index sum-type is primary unique sum-type.
     2025   .
     2026   define temp-table tt-allsum no-undo
     2027   field sum-type           as   character
     2028   field fact-qnty             as decimal
     2029   field cli-qnty              as decimal
     2030   field sum-dsc-base-doc      as decimal
     2031   field sum-dsc-rubl-doc      as decimal
     2032   field dsc-base-doc          as decimal
     2033   field dsc-rubl-doc          as decimal
     2034   field vat-base-doc          as decimal
